---
layout: layouts/base.njk
bodyClass: home
---
{% set check %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>{% endset %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Websites, WordPress and automation</p>
      <h1 class="display">Fast websites,<br>built properly.</h1>
      <p class="lead">I'm Hafez. I build websites, online stores and automations for businesses and agencies. Two things I never trade away: <strong>speed</strong> and <strong>quality</strong>.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/website-check/">Get a free website check</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/work/">See my work</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-points">
        <li>{{ check | safe }}Custom code, no templates</li>
        <li>{{ check | safe }}Arabic and English, real RTL</li>
        <li>{{ check | safe }}You own everything</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-photo reveal">
      <img src="{{ site.photo }}" alt="Hafez Fandy" width="720" height="900" fetchpriority="high">
      <p class="hero-tag"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Taking new projects</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="pillars-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What I stand for</p>
        <h2 class="h-xl" id="pillars-title">Speed and quality, both at once.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Most projects pick one. Fast and sloppy, or careful and slow to load. I build so you get both, and I show you the proof instead of asking you to take my word for it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars">
      <article class="pillar reveal">
        <p class="pillar-word">Speed</p>
        <p>Pages that load fast on real phones and real connections, and quick answers when you need something.</p>
        <div class="pillar-visual" role="img" aria-label="Illustration: a page weighed down by heavy themes and plugins loads far slower than a lean, hand-built page.">
          <div class="load-row"><span>Heavy theme + plugins</span><span class="load-track"><span class="load-fill slow"></span></span></div>
          <div class="load-row"><span>Lean, hand-built</span><span class="load-track"><span class="load-fill fast"></span></span></div>
          <p class="visual-note">Illustration. Test this site yourself on <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis?url={{ site.url | urlencode }}" rel="noopener">PageSpeed Insights</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar reveal">
        <p class="pillar-word">Quality</p>
        <p>Code that is clean, accessible and easy for the next developer to work on. Built to last past launch day.</p>
        <div class="pillar-visual">
          <ul class="checklist">
            {% for item in ["Hand-written code, no bloated templates", "Works on every screen and browser", "Accessible to keyboard and screen-reader users", "Secure, updated and backed up", "Clean handover: you own the code, domain and hosting"] %}
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path class="check-path" pathLength="1" d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>{{ item }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
        <h2 class="h-xl" id="services-title">What I can do for your business.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>From a first website to an online store, to the automations that save your team hours every week. <a class="text-link" href="/services/">All services <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-grid">
      {% for s in services %}
        {% if s.proof.length %}
        <a class="service-card reveal" href="/work/{{ s.proof[0] }}/">
          <span class="service-num">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>
          <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.short }}</p>
          <span class="service-proof">See the work <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
        </a>
        {% else %}
        <div class="service-card reveal">
          <span class="service-num">{{ loop.index | pad }}</span>
          <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.short }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="h-xl" id="process-title">Three steps. No guesswork.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step reveal">
        <span class="step-num">1</span>
        <h3>Free website check</h3>
        <p>Send me your website or Google Maps link. I look at speed, mobile, search and how easy it is to contact you, then tell you plainly what matters most.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step reveal">
        <span class="step-num">2</span>
        <h3>Plan and quote</h3>
        <p>You get a clear plan: what I will build, what it fixes, and a fixed quote. No surprises later.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step reveal">
        <span class="step-num">3</span>
        <h3>Build and care</h3>
        <p>I build it, you review it, we launch. After that I can keep it updated, backed up and working with a monthly care plan.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
        <h2 class="h-xl" id="work-title">Built from scratch, built to be used.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Concept builds that show how I work, from custom WordPress themes to bilingual landing pages. <a class="text-link" href="/work/">All work <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      {% for item in collections.work | limit(2) %}
      {% include "partials/work-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.reviews.length %}
<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="reviews-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Reviews</p>
        <h2 class="h-xl" id="reviews-title">What clients say.</h2>
      </div>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/reviews/">All reviews <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="review-grid">
      {% for review in collections.reviews | limit(2) %}
      {% include "partials/review-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section section-border" aria-labelledby="insights-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Insights</p>
        <h2 class="h-xl" id="insights-title">Practical notes on the web and your business.</h2>
      </div>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/insights/">All insights <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="insight-cards">
      {% for post in collections.insights | limit(3) %}
      <a class="insight-card reveal" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="tag">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="post-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
      <h2 class="h-xl">Is your website helping or hurting?</h2>
      <p>Get a free check of your website or Google listing. You will get a short, honest list of what to fix first, whether or not you hire me.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/website-check/">Get a free website check</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}">Message me on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
